  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GATEWAY PROJECT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As stated abovecomma the PDO has not been changed. Howevercomma it is useful to note the following.   The Projectcomma which was originally conceived as an APLcomma was also meant to prepare the APL 2 whose development objective was to consolidate the Free Zone (FZ) functions and financingcomma and secure managerial and financial autonomy for GIPFZA. This phase [would have] also deepened the production linkages of the FZ with the local economy.  Howevercomma the idea of an APL 2 was dropped from the Country Assistance Strategy since this instrument no longer corresponds to the country&apos;s needs in terms of growth and competitiveness.  While the PDO is maintainedcomma a first order restructuring was completed including:  (i) formally close component 3: Support to the Gambia Divestiture Agency and reallocate the funds of this underperforming component to a new component; (ii) formally close component 4: Capacity Buildingcomma to further focus the project#s scope; (iii) add a component: Preparatory work for the Divestiture of the Groundnut sectorcomma to meet an urgent Government request to help improve the performance of the groundnut sector; (iv) restructure the Results Framework so that it is more focusedcomma simpler and easier to use as a monitoring and evaluation tool; and (v) funds are reallocated across categories.</narrative>
  </description>
